  "chapter_readings": [
    {
      "text": "The children bring the radio. A little blue stone falls out of a small hidden compartment. Tom puts it into the bird’s wing. The children call out: “Reparo!” The golden bird flaps its wings and begins to sing happily. Butterflies dance in the air. “Good job!” says Radiophone. “I’m staying with you forever!”",
